  "title": "CompoSecure Announces Completion of Spin-Off of Resolute Holdings",
  "summary": "SOMERSET, N.J., and NEW YORK, Feb. 28, 2025 — CompoSecure, Inc. (Nasdaq: CMPO) (“CompoSecure”), a leader in metal payment cards, security, and authentication solutions, today announced the completion of the spin-off of its subsidiary, Resolute Holdings Management, Inc. (Nasdaq: RHLD) (“Resolute Holdings”), into a separate public company, effective 12:01 a.m. Eastern Standard Time on February […]",
